        "text": "Penetration Test Robot\nThe application that we will use in this chapter is called the Penetration Test\nRobot ( pentest_robot.py ). This tool will take advantage of the remoting proto-\ncols in Windows and Linux OS. To access a Windows system, we can use RDP\n(port 3389), and to access a Linux OS remotely, we can use SSH (port 22). This\ntool aims to automate the process and scan a single IP or range and look for these\ntwo services. If they\u2019re up, then the tool will try to automate a dictionary attack.\nPentest Automation with Python\n412\nChapter 18 I Pentest Automation with Python\nEsta secci\u00f3n contiene las siguientes subsecciones\n\u2022 Application Workflow\nSi deseas explorar cualquiera de estas subsecciones, puedes pregunt\u00e1rmelo directamente.",
